FerrionOS change to base (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 20f7573b4dc011ea5267189185edc0b2f12bab0f with the patches listed before it in recipes/core/base/recipe.toml applied:
- virtio-gpud: presenting a frame (the transfer to the host and the flush on the control queue) no longer holds up the scheme's other requests, so a cursor move reaches the cursor queue while a frame is in flight; frames keep their order.
- driver-graphics and scheme-utils: the readiness-based dispatch lets a request finish later without blocking the requests after it.

